<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  CBR007 Structure Inventory - Detailed, ported from legacy's JasperServer report
  (cbr-legacy jasper-server .../CBR007_StructureInventoryDetailed.rpt_jrxml), layout unchanged but
  for two faults it had:
  - Curb Type's value ran 436 points wide, under the "Load Rating Review Required" label on the same
    line; it now stops before it.
  - Last Inspection Date had 47 points for a 45-point date; its divider moves left so it has 52.

  As in STRUCTURE_INVENTORY_SUMMARY, the port fills from rows rather than SQL - legacy called
  CBR_STRCTRE_INVNTRY_DTL_RPT with a WHERE clause built as a string - every field already formatted
  as legacy's patterns printed it. The ministry line (the CBR_HEADER subreport) is P_MINISTRY, the
  logo comes from the classpath through P_LOGO, and Date Printed is P_DATE_PRINTED, in Pacific time.
-->
